    "section": "01. Combat Patrol Mission Sequence",
    "ruleNumber": "01.11",
    "summary": "When the battle ends, the player with more VP wins; equal VP is a draw.\n\nEach player scores VP for:\n\n- their own Combat Patrol mission\n- 10 VP for painting their army to Battle Ready standard\n\nFor a new player’s first few games with their Combat Patrol, ignoring the painting VP is recommended, but Combat Patrol events still award it.",
